// The manifest pins `sprout` at a hash the source that travelled does not
// hash to. That is said once, at the manifest: the world, what visitors
// are made of, and the hall are all made of `sprout`, and their kinds
// being unknown are consequences of the one problem rather than three more.
world library_mismatched is sprout.World {
  visitors are Person
  visitors arrive at hall

  object hall is sprout.Place
}
